        <content type="html" xml:base="/events/2014-02-04-abstract-machines-tdd-sudoku/">&lt;h2 id=&quot;talk-1-abstract-machines&quot;&gt;Talk 1: Abstract Machines&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From cellular automata to turing machines...&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;a href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;twitter.com&#x2F;igorwhiletrue&quot;&gt;Igor Wiedler&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;talk-2-small-steps-the-magic-of-tdd-sudoku-edition&quot;&gt;Talk 2: Small Steps - The Magic of TDD (sudoku edition)&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Programming is magic! Watch live, as I make a &lt;a href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.google.de&#x2F;search?q=sudoku+tdd&quot;&gt;Sudoku solver&lt;&#x2F;a&gt; jump out of an empty TDD hat.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
